TI  - Temporal Trends of Hexabromocyclododecanes (HBCDs) and Polybrominated Diphenyl Ethers (PBDEs) and Detection of Two Novel Flame Retardants in Marine Mammals from Hong Kong, South China
T2  - ENVIRONMENTAL SCIENCE & TECHNOLOGY
LA  - English
KW  - HARBOR PORPOISES
KW  - TETRABROMOBISPHENOL-A
KW  - SOUSA-CHINENSIS
