TI  - Boat traffic affects the acoustic behaviour of Pacific humpback dolphins, Sousa chinensis
T2  - JOURNAL OF THE MARINE BIOLOGICAL ASSOCIATION OF THE UNITED KINGDOM
LA  - English
KW  - BOTTLE-NOSED DOLPHINS
KW  - ALGOA BAY
